__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
mutants/
.mutmut-cache

# Regenerable build output. A single `make suite` run over the 4 scenarios
# is already ~90MB of per-decision JSONL; the 30-seed x 2-workflow x
# multi-scenario Phase 3 sweep would be orders of magnitude more. Everything
# under out/ is reproducible from the pinned engine commits (engines.lock)
# + the frozen seed list (prereg/seeds.json) + this repo's code, so raw
# per-decision evidence sets and run logs are not committed. Small
# aggregated summaries that later steps read directly (out/metrics.json,
# out/quality.json, out/results/*.json, out/paper/) ARE committed as an
# exception — see the negated patterns below.
out/*
!out/metrics.json
!out/quality.json
!out/results/
!out/paper/
!out/checkers/
